## Docker

```bash
uv run --locked poe dockerize
docker run --rm {{ project_slug }}
```

The image uses the committed lockfile, installs the package without development
dependencies, and runs as UID 10001. Both stages share the same Python base.
Add required runtime assets or explicitly selected extras when your application
needs them. Local environments, caches, and `.env` files are excluded from the
build context. A lockfile must exist before building.
